@RoomsAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5243

### Get rooms
GET {{RoomsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rooms
Accept: application/json

### Book Small Room 10:00-11:00
POST {{RoomsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start": "2030-10-01T10:00:00Z",
  "end": "2030-10-01T11:00:00Z",
  "title": "Team sync"
}

### Overlaps with 10:00-11:00 -> 409
POST {{RoomsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start": "2030-10-01T10:30:00Z",
  "end": "2030-10-01T11:30:00Z",
  "title": "Overlapping meeting"
}

### Starts when the first one ends -> 201
POST {{RoomsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start": "2030-10-01T11:00:00Z",
  "end": "2030-10-01T12:00:00Z",
  "title": "Back-to-back meeting"
}

### Reservations of a room in a time range
GET {{RoomsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/rooms/1/reservations?from=2030-10-01T00:00:00Z&to=2030-10-02T00:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

###
